{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Sanae  $Reimu  >The Hakurei Shrine."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The shrine that stood on the eastern border of Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The shrine trees stained crimson later than the mountain's."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After the battle, Jessica invited the mountain god to her shrine."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"I...think we got off on the wrong foot before.",
                "<l$> We both may have acted a bit rashly.\""
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >\"You're certainly right about that...I give my apologies."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> But surely that's not the only reason for this invitation, right?\""
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"Exactly. I wanted to talk with you about some stuff."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Even if I'd rather not talk about it at all...\""
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >\"Well if you're uncomfortable with the topic...\""
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"I am but...maybe I need to talk about it.\""
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >\"You may be right about that."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Feel free to open your heart a bit,",
                "<l$> and tell me about your worries.\""
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"It's about this uh, youkai thats posessing me.\""
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >\"I figured as much.\""
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"...What's that smug look about?\""
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >\"You're a rare kind of anomaly it seems."
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Human and youkai usually live as seperate beings.\""
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"Well, yeah...so it's unnatural, yes?"
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >\"Ahaha.",
                "<l$> That may be so, but you're not in imbalance.\""
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"Imbalance?"
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> I feel more imbalanced than ever before!",
                "<l$> My whole being is at stake!\""
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >\"Not at all. Don't you see that you are strong?",
                "<l$> You even managed to beat me.\""
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"I beat you because I have skills in danmaku.\""
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >\"Oh wait, I've been rambling, haven't I?\""
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"Yes, yes you have...\""
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Jessica wanted to ask a god to help her get rid",
                "of her new youkai half."
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Kanako however declined that in an instant."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What has been set in motion cannot be halted so easily."
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Jessica didn't want to believe what she said."
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Deep down she may know her fate."
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But even so, her mind fights against it."
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She refuses to believe that she's becoming a youkai."
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By living in denial, she thinks she can ignore the issue to make it go away."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But that's not how that works, now is it?"
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe she'll learn someday..."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "　　"
            ]
        },
        "36_1": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Ending No.02 — Don't ask gods for favors$>"
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> <c$Congratulations, all clear! Just as I'd expected!$>"
            ]
        }
    }
}